source_raw_tex:
\eqalignno{\hat\mu(\bigcap_{1\le j\le n}E_j)
&=\hat\mu(\bigcap_{1\le j\le n}E'_j)
=\Pr(X_{i_1}\in F_1,\ldots,X_{i_n}\in F_n)\cr
&=\prod_{j=1}^n\Pr(X_{i_j}\in F_j)\cr
\noalign{\noindent (using (ii))}
&=\prod_{i=1}^n\hat\mu E_j.\cr}

