oalign{
oindent (by 257B, writing $
u_X	imes
u_Y$ for the product
measure on $\BbbR^2$)}
&=\int h(x+y)
u_{(X,Y)}(d(x,y))\cr

oalign{
oindent (by 272G, writing $
